About the hosted service
------------------------

RIDING BYTES GmbH runs one instance of this software at
https://cloud.kaisho.dev and may charge for accounts on it.
That is a service, not a different product: the instance runs
this code, from this repository, with no private additions.
Billing lives in a separate service that provisions accounts
through the documented admin API and is not part of this
program.

You are under no obligation to use it. Self-hosting is a
first-class path, documented in docs/self-hosting.md, and the
desktop and mobile clients let you point at any server URL.

If you run a modified version of this software as a network
service, section 13 of the AGPL requires you to offer its
source to your users. Set SOURCE_URL to your own repository
so the offer at GET / leads to the code you are actually
running.

